Error [E0103]: `#Root` must mark the first parameter
  --> tests/ui/root_param_shape.jet:1:26
    |
  1 | fn bad(after: Int, #Root value: Int) {
    |                          ^^^^^
 Why: a reversible dot call has one receiver, and it is always the first value parameter
 Fix: move `#Root` to the first parameter

Error [E0103]: `#Root` must mark a bare-read parameter
  --> tests/ui/root_param_shape.jet:5:20
    |
  5 | fn also_bad(#Root &value: Int) {
    |                    ^^^^^
 Why: dot-call syntax never hides a write or move capability behind the receiver
 Fix: remove the write-capability marker `&` or move-capability marker `^` from the `#Root` parameter
